  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "This lesson reviews the placement of clitic pronouns with affirmative and negative commands. In affirmative commands, object pronouns follow the verb and are attached to it (e.g., \"Tráigamelo\" – Bring it to me). In negative commands, the object pronouns precede the verb and come after \"no\" (e.g., \"No me lo traiga\" – Don't bring it to me). Two clitic pronouns retain their relative order regardless of position."
    }
  ],
